/-! ## REG-4 — Schmidt-aux dominant regime UNCONDITIONAL Type-(a) -/

/-- **REG-4 — `T5_REGULUS_v8d5_schmidt_aux_dominant_regime`**: the
    UNCONDITIONAL Type-(a) discharge of V8-D5 inequality at any
    `(P, R, q, ε, t)` instance under the dominant Schmidt-aux regime
